# .assetsignore — Workers static-assets upload filter (gitignore format).
# Wrangler 4.127.1 reads this from the root of the assets directory (the
# repo root) and skips every matching file (verified against the installed
# wrangler's asset walk + current Cloudflare docs; negation patterns work).
#
# The public site is EXACTLY ONE file — index.html — at the repo root.
# Exclude everything else (sources, docs, dev state) from the asset bundle:
*
!index.html
